Kind: widen
Issue: #924
Holds open: the window between a wake choosing a multi-waiter's slot and waking it -- 20 ms of delay() before the wake, only for a wake between threads of one task, so that cap_test's [37] meets it and the rest of the boot (ext_server's FLIPC reactor and its clients, other tasks) does not; with the fix the delay is spent holding futexv_lock, and the slot cannot change owner
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4

diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/sync_sema.c b/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/sync_sema.c
index 1a91bed8..e10986b1 100644
--- a/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/sync_sema.c
+++ b/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/sync_sema.c
@@ -691,8 +691,15 @@ futexv_wake_key(event_t key)
 			continue;
 		for (k = 0; k < w->nr; k++) {
 			if (w->keys[k] == key) {
+				extern void delay(int);
+
 				if (w->woken_index < 0)
 					w->woken_index = (int) k;
+				/* 924-widen-late-wake: a wake between threads of
+				 * one task waits 20 ms after its slot is chosen */
+				if (w->thread->top_act != THR_ACT_NULL &&
+				    w->thread->top_act->task == current_task())
+					delay(20000);
 				thread_wakeup_one((event_t) w);
 				break;
 			}
